@startuml Admin_AI_Enhancements_Sequence
!theme plain
autonumber

actor Admin
participant "Admin Dashboard (React)" as FE
participant "Betting.Api" as API
participant "AiAssistantService" as Service
participant "Google Gemini API" as Gemini

== AI Insights Analytics: Regeneracja ==
Admin -> FE : Kliknięcie "Regeneruj" przy meczu
FE -> API : POST /api/AiAssistant/event/{eventId}/regenerate
activate API
API -> Service : RegenerateInsightAsync(eventId)
activate Service
Service -> Gemini : GenerateTextAsync(Context Injection)
Gemini --> Service : Nowa analiza
Service -> Service : Logowanie do AiGenerationLogs
Service --> API : Success (New Insight)
deactivate Service
API --> FE : 200 OK { insight: "..." }
deactivate API
FE -> Admin : Odświeżenie widoku analizy
@enduml